Blacklight is a action, thriller, adventure film directed by Mark Williams.

3
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:42,000
Travis Block is a shadowy Government agent who specializes in
removing operatives whose covers have been exposed.

4
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:54,000
He then has to uncover a deadly conspiracy within his own
ranks that reaches the highest echelons of power.

5
