11
00:57:12,000 --> 00:57:18,000
Blacklight is a 2022 action thriller film directed
and co-written by Mark Williams.

12
01:02:24,000 --> 01:02:30,000
The film stars Liam Neeson as a brooding FBI fixer who becomes involved in a government
conspiracy; Emmy Raver-Lampman, Taylor John Smith, and Aidan Quinn also star.

13
01:07:36,000 --> 01:07:42,000
Blacklight was released in the United States on February
11, 2022, by Briarcliff Entertainment.

14
01:12:48,000 --> 01:12:54,000
It struggled both commercially and critically.

15
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
With a production budget of $43 million, it only grossed about $16
million worldwide, making it a box-office bomb.

16
01:23:12,000 --> 01:23:18,000
It received overwhelmingly negative reviews from critics, with some
calling it one of Liam Neeson's worst performances and movies.

17
01:28:24,000 --> 01:28:30,000
The storyline, action sequences, and overall direction were widely criticized,
adding to its reputation as a low point in Neeson's career.

18
01:33:36,000 --> 01:33:42,000
The film explores themes of undercover agent,
hitman, blackmail, fbi, conspiracy.

19
01:38:48,000 --> 01:38:54,000
The tone is emotional and intense.
